## Prose Style

Each sentence should be its own paragraph.

Do not group multiple sentences into the same paragraph block.

Never use italics, bold, or emphasis (no `*text*`, `_text_`, or `**text**`) in any file.

When a description, comment, or attribution is unknown, leave it blank rather than writing "(unknown)" or "(not named in audio)".

The reader can see the field is empty and does not need the absence justified. Keep the structural element, drop only the explanation.
